cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Code and data pipeline for "The excitation-inhibition ratio cannot identify
  its own cause: release statistics separate primary from compensatory
  presynaptic change in autism"
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "[GIVEN NAME]"
    family-names: "[FAMILY NAME]"
